> the inclusive prefix sum over the subgroup of lane
  ucas: it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = sg_scan(lane)
  ucas: show it
it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = sg_scan(lane)
  -> u32
> the exclusive prefix sum of the lanes of x where x is a u8
  ucas: it(lane: u32 in 0..31, x: u8) = sg_exclusive(x)
  ucas: show it
it(lane: u32 in 0..31, x: u8) = sg_scan(x) - x
  -> u8
> the ballot of the lanes where lane is odd
  ucas: it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = sg_ballot(lane % 2 != 0)
  ucas: show it
it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = 2863311530
  -> u32
> the ballot of lane is even
  ucas: it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = sg_ballot(lane % 2 == 0)
  ucas: show it
it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = 1431655765
  -> u32
> the number of lanes where lane is less than 5
  ucas: it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = popcount(sg_ballot(lane < 5))
  ucas: show it
it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = 5
  -> u32
> how many lanes where lane is greater than 28?
  ucas: it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = popcount(sg_ballot(lane > 28))
  ucas: show it
it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = 3
  -> u32
> whether in any lane lane is 3
  ucas: it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = sg_any(lane == 3)
  ucas: show it
it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = 1
  -> bool
> whether every lane where lane is nonnegative
  ucas: it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = sg_all(lane >= 0)
  ucas: show it
it(lane: u32 in 0..31) = 1
  -> bool
